{
    "title": "Smartsheet: Projects & Teams",
    "description": "Getting started is easy! Either sign in with your existing Smartsheet account or enter your email to sign up for a free 30-day trial. Join millions of other innovative users and upgrade to a paid account at any time.\r\n\r\nUse Smartsheet, a work execution platform that empowers better collaboration and project management. Smartsheet offers rich views, workflows, reports, and dashboards for successful project planning. Smartsheet accelerates innovation in 190 countries for 80,000+ leading brands\u2014including 75% of the Fortune 500.\r\n\r\nManage projects and tasks, automate workflows, collaborate with your team, and maximize productivity anytime, anywhere!\r\nEmpower your team to plan, track, automate, and deliver projects like a pro.\r\n\r\nWith Smartsheet, you can:\r\n\r\nCOLLABORATE WITH YOUR TEAM\r\n\u2022 Create, share, and collaborate with your team on projects anywhere.\r\n\u2022 Access your projects, tasks, workflows, and sheets anytime.\r\n\u2022 Get business collaboration and productivity tools to help manage and plan teamwork.\r\n\u2022 Review and edit documents and sheets that your team is working on.\r\n\r\nORGANIZE PROJECTS & TASKS\r\n\u2022 Use sheets to oversee tasks and workflows, plan and track projects, and maximize your team's productivity.\r\n\u2022 Add assignees, due dates, followers, checklists, predecessors, and files to your tasks and follow the progress of your projects to track everything effectively.\r\n\u2022 Plan your project and choose how to visualize tasks switching between grid, card, Gantt, and calendar views with the same data.\r\n\u2022 Keep everyone on the same page. Attach files from Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, and more.\r\n\u2022 Send automated updates and approval requests to streamline work and reduce the need for meetings to increase productivity.\r\n\u2022 Use dashboards to showcase sheets, reports, charts, and forms and visualize tasks clearly.\r\n\r\nAUTOMATE WORKFLOWS\r\n\u2022 Implement simple and powerful automated workflows in minutes to better track progress and manage efficiency.\r\n\u2022 Automate repetitive processes by sending alerts, requesting approvals and updates, and maximize productivity.\r\n\r\nWORK IN ONE PLACE\r\n\u2022 See work alongside key conversations, decisions, and rationale in one place\u2014improve project visibility and task management.\r\n\u2022 Share spreadsheets with others to view, edit, or add comments, and collaborate anywhere.\r\n\r\nCOLLECT INFORMATION WITH FORMS\r\n \u2022 Collect data from the field with forms, capture and upload images, or scan barcodes to track inputs in real time.\r\n\u2022 Capture information in low or no-connectivity environments with offline forms.\r\n\u2022 Collect and act on error-free, consistent data from stakeholders.\r\n\u2022 Create forms that automatically map to the columns in your sheets.\r\n\u2022 Provide easy access by embedding forms on dashboards and websites\r\n\r\nTAKE ACTION & INCREASE PRODUCTIVITY\r\n\u2022 Get notifications to your Inbox about the projects, tasks, and workflows you\u2019re following.\r\n\u2022 Act on requests and approvals or update status in card view.\r\n\r\nVIEW WORK STATUS IN REAL TIME\r\n\u2022 View and manage your dashboards, sheets, and more in real-time from your phone, so you always know the status of work.\r\n\u2022 Give project owners, stakeholders, and leadership a robust, real-time view into the status of top KPIs, critical trends, and summary reports.\r\n\u2022 Rapidly adapt to changing conditions and identify trends with easy-to-use widget dashboards that display live data, charts, and key metrics.\r\n\r\n\r\nWORK SEAMLESSLY WITH YOUR FAVORITE APPS\r\n\u2022 Enable real-time synchronization and visibility with many of the apps you use, so you can easily track tasks, compile data in spreadsheets, and collaborate with your team, all in one place.\r\n\u2022 This allows for improved collaboration, task management, and maximized productivity across your tech stack.\r\n\r\nBUILD PURPOSE BUILT APPS WITHOUT CODING\r\n\u2022 WorkApps is a no-code platform for building intuitive web and mobile apps to streamline your business.\r\n\r\nSmartsheet is built to plan, track, manage, automate, and report on work at scale.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about Smartsheet, visit https://www.smartsheet.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Getting started is easy! Either sign in with your existing Smartsheet account or enter your email to sign up for a free 30-day trial. Join millions of other innovative users and upgrade to a paid account at any time.<br><br>Use Smartsheet, a work execution platform that empowers better collaboration and project management. Smartsheet offers rich views, workflows, reports, and dashboards for successful project planning. Smartsheet accelerates innovation in 190 countries for 80,000+ leading brands\u2014including 75% of the Fortune 500.<br><br>Manage projects and tasks, automate workflows, collaborate with your team, and maximize productivity anytime, anywhere!<br>Empower your team to plan, track, automate, and deliver projects like a pro.<br><br>With Smartsheet, you can:<br><br>COLLABORATE WITH YOUR TEAM<br>\u2022 Create, share, and collaborate with your team on projects anywhere.<br>\u2022 Access your projects, tasks, workflows, and sheets anytime.<br>\u2022 Get business collaboration and productivity tools to help manage and plan teamwork.<br>\u2022 Review and edit documents and sheets that your team is working on.<br><br>ORGANIZE PROJECTS &amp; TASKS<br>\u2022 Use sheets to oversee tasks and workflows, plan and track projects, and maximize your team&#39;s productivity.<br>\u2022 Add assignees, due dates, followers, checklists, predecessors, and files to your tasks and follow the progress of your projects to track everything effectively.<br>\u2022 Plan your project and choose how to visualize tasks switching between grid, card, Gantt, and calendar views with the same data.<br>\u2022 Keep everyone on the same page. Attach files from Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, and more.<br>\u2022 Send automated updates and approval requests to streamline work and reduce the need for meetings to increase productivity.<br>\u2022 Use dashboards to showcase sheets, reports, charts, and forms and visualize tasks clearly.<br><br>AUTOMATE WORKFLOWS<br>\u2022 Implement simple and powerful automated workflows in minutes to better track progress and manage efficiency.<br>\u2022 Automate repetitive processes by sending alerts, requesting approvals and updates, and maximize productivity.<br><br>WORK IN ONE PLACE<br>\u2022 See work alongside key conversations, decisions, and rationale in one place\u2014improve project visibility and task management.<br>\u2022 Share spreadsheets with others to view, edit, or add comments, and collaborate anywhere.<br><br>COLLECT INFORMATION WITH FORMS<br> \u2022 Collect data from the field with forms, capture and upload images, or scan barcodes to track inputs in real time.<br>\u2022 Capture information in low or no-connectivity environments with offline forms.<br>\u2022 Collect and act on error-free, consistent data from stakeholders.<br>\u2022 Create forms that automatically map to the columns in your sheets.<br>\u2022 Provide easy access by embedding forms on dashboards and websites<br><br>TAKE ACTION &amp; INCREASE PRODUCTIVITY<br>\u2022 Get notifications to your Inbox about the projects, tasks, and workflows you\u2019re following.<br>\u2022 Act on requests and approvals or update status in card view.<br><br>VIEW WORK STATUS IN REAL TIME<br>\u2022 View and manage your dashboards, sheets, and more in real-time from your phone, so you always know the status of work.<br>\u2022 Give project owners, stakeholders, and leadership a robust, real-time view into the status of top KPIs, critical trends, and summary reports.<br>\u2022 Rapidly adapt to changing conditions and identify trends with easy-to-use widget dashboards that display live data, charts, and key metrics.<br><br><br>WORK SEAMLESSLY WITH YOUR FAVORITE APPS<br>\u2022 Enable real-time synchronization and visibility with many of the apps you use, so you can easily track tasks, compile data in spreadsheets, and collaborate with your team, all in one place.<br>\u2022 This allows for improved collaboration, task management, and maximized productivity across your tech stack.<br><br>BUILD PURPOSE BUILT APPS WITHOUT CODING<br>\u2022 WorkApps is a no-code platform for building intuitive web and mobile apps to streamline your business.<br><br>Smartsheet is built to plan, track, manage, automate, and report on work at scale.<br><br>To learn more about Smartsheet, visit https://www.smartsheet.com.",
